<mxCell id="c165" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Connectors are drawn for the primary (identifying) relationship of each foreign key. Duplicated owner keys (landlord_id / tenant_id) that exist for row-level security are listed as FK attributes without connectors.&lt;br&gt;2. profiles.id references Supabase auth.users(id).&lt;br&gt;3. conversation_participants is the associative entity resolving the many-to-many between profiles and conversations." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=10.8;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1f2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="1514" width="270" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
